  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to enhance ethical compliance and accountability in the RollCall system. I support the proposals for a compliance review process for data retention policies (SAF-04) that aligns with sustainability goals and regulatory requirements. Additionally, I propose a synthesis where we ensure that the performance monitoring system includes mechanisms for transparency in attendance recording (RES-02) and allows students to dispute attendance records (RES-03) effectively. This will ensure that we maintain fairness and accountability while balancing performance and compliance.",
